2` 的完整依赖链和历史证据，包含 `f3056aab`：打开设置后，变码/全码/简码只更新本地偏好，关闭设置后的下一次干净连接应用选择；旧会话不恢复，未知结果仍锁定，旧提交不重放。\n\n交付流程补齐 main PR 和 main push 的离线编译/完整制包 CI，采用新版本 test.12，保持源码 SHA、v2 协议、资源和六个签名观察的一致性。保留 main 的 PR #93/#94 诊断与证据改动。同步 PR #97 的测试夹具作用域修复及错误路径负例，避免维护序列测试假通过；没有合并或关闭该 PR。\n\n验证：\n- Go 174 项顶层回归通过；设置 DOWN/UP 三模式 × 普通暂停/未知锁定六个子场景全部通过。三项需要额外词典或宿主环境的测试保持原跳过。\n- Python 107/108 通过；本机符号链接用例因 WinError 1314 未完成；本 PR 的 Windows CI 随后已原样通过全部 15 项 assembly 检查，无跳过。\n- PS5/PS7 八次隔离维护测试通过。\n- 标准 TIP、专用 TIP、注册工具和宿主检查器编译通过；仅执行六项内存/纯合同测试，全部通过。安装版 Go 前端编译通过。\n- 新增工作流合同及 main 诊断/证据保留回归通过。五项 PR 工作流现已全部通过，含完整制包、三组 real-Rime、Go race 和标准原生构建。\n\n[整合差异、验证记录与交付门槛](https://github.com/tsaanghwang/Yime/blob/cb8bd659cd1f397bb76c7f848670be89fc48066d/docs/testing/18u/2026-11-05/main-integration/REVIEW.zh-CN.md)；原始历史证据字节未改写。PR 合并测试包与 main 合并后包分别绑定其 SHA，test.11 的固定交付保持历史身份。\n\n本轮仅源码整合、离线验证及 PR 提交。不安装、不改变注册或默认输入法、不操作用户数据；原工作区未跟踪文件保留。不声称真实宿主或物理验收通过，也不直接合并 main。\n\nCI（head `cb8bd659cd1f397bb76c7f848670be89fc48066d`；合并测试源码 `df3d9351bdcda9f167473f6d5090506a8dd37bd8`）：\n- [Build](https://github.com/tsaanghwang/Yime/actions/runs/41975718938) — success，含所有必需任务；三个显式授权的注册/语言探针保持关闭。\n- [Touch terminal prototype](https://github.com/tsaanghwang/Yime/actions/runs/41975718890) — success。\n- [18u async route contracts](https://github.com/tsaanghwang/Yime/actions/runs/41975718911) — success。\n- [Installed 18u compile and offline checks](https://github.com/tsaanghwang/Yime/actions/runs/41975718945) — success，完整词典、同源 v2 前端/TIP、test.12 制包及证据上传成功。\n- [CI retention tests](https://github.com/tsaanghwang/Yime/actions/runs/41975718927) — success。\n\nCI 产物（未下载/安装，不作为真人或已安装验收）：\n- [test.12 完整包 artifact](https://github.com/tsaanghwang/Yime/actions/runs/41975718945/artifacts/13391537298)，名称 `installed-18u-x64-test-package-df3d9351bdcda9f167473f6d5090506a8dd37bd8`；GitHub 报告的 artifact 外层 ZIP SHA-256：`2f15e1116fc35c0052e27684c4e95bd651712e2b9b8a03881d713e3b620122a5`。\n- [编译/离线/制包证据](https://github.com/tsaanghwang/Yime/actions/runs/41975718945/artifacts/13392006565)，GitHub 报告的 artifact SHA-256：`08979811edbe85f379be53dc3d9c52b077b39838030a3aa294d4f5d20922fd0a`。\n\n此包绑定 PR 合并测试 SHA，实际合入 main 后由 main push 重新生成对应源码包；不得只替换单个 EXE 或复用 test.11 版本身份。","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-11-05T05:42:38Z","updated_at":"2026-11-05T08:17:54Z","closed_at":"2026-11-05T08:17:54Z","merged_at":"2026-11-05T08:17:54Z","merge_commit_sha":"36ca828b3531d6c61740e02b6835aa930442b97a","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"tsaanghwang:codex/18u-main-integration-20261105","ref":"codex/18u-main-integration-20261105","repo":{"id":1290551145,"node_id":"R_kgDOTOw_aQ","name":"Yime","full_name":"tsaanghwang/Yime","owner":{"login":"tsaanghwang","id":207723120,"node_id":"U_kgDODGGacA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/207723120?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tsaanghwang","html_url":"https://github.com/tsaanghwang","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tsaanghwang/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tsaanghwang/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tsaanghwang/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tsaanghwang/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tsaanghwang/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tsaanghwang/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tsaanghwang/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tsaanghwang/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tsaanghwang/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"private":false,"fork":false,"archived":false,"disabled":false,"description":"Yime for Windows: a PIME-hosted, Rime-powered Chinese phonetic input method.","homepage":"https://github.com/tsaanghwang/Yime","language":"C++","visibility":"public","is_template":false,"topics":["chinese-in